      "id": 3,
      "name": "Garlic Beef Rice Bowl",
      "description": "A delicious and flavorful rice bowl with seasoned beef, caramelized onions, and garlic",
      "ingredients": [
        "Beef",
        "Onion",
        "Garlic",
        "Rice"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "Cook rice according to package instructions.",
        "In a skillet, heat some oil over medium-high heat.",
        "Add sliced onions and cook until caramelized, then remove from skillet.",
        "In the same skillet, add thinly sliced beef and minced garlic, cook until beef is browned.",
        "Assemble the rice bowl by placing rice at the bottom, topping with beef and garlic mixture, and finishing with caramelized onions.",
        "Serve hot and enjoy!"
