      "name": "Beef and Rice Skillet",
      "description": "A flavorful and hearty one-pan meal with tender beef, onions, garlic, and rice.",
      "ingredients": [
        "Beef",
        "Onion",
        "Garlic",
        "Rice"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "In a large skillet, cook ground beef over medium heat until browned.",
        "Add chopped onions and minced garlic to the skillet, cook until onions are soft.",
        "Stir in uncooked rice and cook for 1-2 minutes to toast the rice.",
