      "id": 7,
      "name": "Beef and Rice Stuffed Zucchini",
      "description": "Delicious and healthy stuffed zucchini with a flavorful beef and rice filling.",
      "ingredients": [
        "Beef",
        "Onion",
        "Garlic",
        "Rice",
        "Zucchini"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
        "Cut the zucchinis in half lengthwise and scoop out the seeds to create a hollow center.",
        "In a skillet, cook the beef, onion, and garlic until the beef is browned and the onion is translucent.",
        "Add cooked rice to the beef mixture and stir to combine.",
        "Fill each zucchini half with the beef and rice mixture.",
        "Place the stuffed zucchinis on a baking sheet and bake for 25-30 minutes until the zucchinis are tender.",
        "Serve hot and enjoy!"
      ],
